# Deny everything, then re-include only what the image needs.
#
# A whitelist rather than a blacklist: the build context is now the repo root,
# which contains .env. A new secret-bearing file must never be able to enter the
# image just because nobody remembered to add it here.
*

!.devcontainer
.devcontainer/*.md

# Only the provider config from this directory — never opencode/auth.json or
# opencode/data/, which hold real credentials and session state locally.
!opencode
opencode/*
!opencode/opencode.jsonc
